ks things (lol)\u2014which means you\u2019ll love the deep yet deceptively simple strategy this game offers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412270/extras/4cc62e90c43f6c0a5726a96e6d20b5f4.poster.avif?t=1755534688\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412270/extras/4cc62e90c43f6c0a5726a96e6d20b5f4.webm?t=1755534688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412270/extras/4cc62e90c43f6c0a5726a96e6d20b5f4.mp4?t=1755534688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s <strong>big-brain</strong> if you want it to be, yet extremely easy to pick up and play. Either way, your fate is in your hands\u2026 potentially.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Major Arcana have been lost to time. A mysterious figure known as The Collector (yeah, kinda sus) seeks them out. With your help, you\u2019ll uncover the secrets of the Tarot \u2728 in Encounter \u2014 a solo roguelike where every card tests your resolve and reshapes your destiny.",
